{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972580/extras/8029778446efac5d0e16cbdeb8b69c06.webp?t=1768241871\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972580/extras/8029778446efac5d0e16cbdeb8b69c06.poster.avif?t=1768241871\" class=\"bb_img\" width=489 height=243 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flappy Witch</strong> is a short but enchanting adventure about a witch and her beloved cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When her cat is taken away by humans, the witch jumps on her broom and begins a journey to bring it back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as the path unfolds, she must walk a fine line between the power of love\u2026 and the temptation of dark magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face dangerous foes, dodge mystical obstacles, and test your reflexes in a world filled with both wonder and shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will the witch\u2019s heart remain pure, or will darkness consume her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972580/extras/cd79e7ccaab2ac96ffc41793362fbe9b.webp?t=1768241871\" width=150 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Simple yet challenging gameplay inspired by classic arcade mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Atmospheric pixel art crafted with a magical touch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A short but emotional story about love, courage, and sacrifice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Perfect for players who enjoy fast-paced, skill-based experiences</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you guide the witch through the skies and reunite her with her cat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>playtime: &lt;1hour</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragra